{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dying is not the end</strong>, but one step forward towards victory. Sharpen your bioengineered swords, prepare your fleshy rifles and set your tactical abilities. To earn your place on Kepler0, you must win the war against the Ancestors: mysterious, god-like humanoids that want to exterminate us.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GO MELEE, GO RANGE, GO TACTICAL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The combat of CRETE is intense, fast, tactical and full of unique moments. Find your style and combine devastating Melee attacks with precise Range shots, use your abilities to create opportunities, protect yourself or your partner, or blast all your enemies at once.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2022610/extras/269924edecec8e2d86c55f93ff9384a1.poster.avif?t=1770388577\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2022610/extras/269924edecec8e2d86c55f93ff9384a1.webm?t=1770388577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2022610/extras/269924edecec8e2d86c55f93ff9384a1.mp4?t=1770388577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TRUE COOPERATIVE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play CRETE as a lonely warrior; however, playing together is the ultimate experience. Combine your attacks, protect each other, find your synchronised tactics and share your progress. Cooperation is not an option, but the only way to survive on this planet. The world is waiting to demonstrate the real meaning of teamwork. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2022610/extras/c743866c300fd3983841ed4d1abe2d36.poster.avif?t=1770388577\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2022610/extras/c743866c300fd3983841ed4d1abe2d36.webm?t=1770388577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2022610/extras/c743866c300fd3983841ed4d1abe2d36.mp4?t=1770388577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >IMPROVE USING BIOENGINEERING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mutate your body and weapons using DNA samples, mutations and organic devices. You will find dozens of biomechanical weapons, ready to be mutated with millions of combinations. Help to develop different buildings and investigations in the base camp and find new ways of getting stronger through advanced bioengineering.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2022610/extras/dff795563269a622a16049e5ae0360d9.poster.avif?t=1770388577\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2022610/extras/dff795563269a622a16049e5ae0360d9.webm?t=1770388577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2022610/extras/dff795563269a622a16049e5ae0360d9.mp4?t=1770388577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2022610?t=1770388577","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2022610?t=1770388577","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2022610/1816b237eef0f54bf2bca9550415342b4ead0ea7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770388577","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2022610/1816b237eef0f54bf2bca9550415342b4ead0ea7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770388577","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Gameplay includes violent combat with ranged weapons and melee, including blood and injuries."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dying is not the end</strong>, but one step forward towards victory. Sharpen your bioengineered swords, prepare your fleshy rifles and set your tactical abilities. To earn your place on Kepler0, you must win the war against the Ancestors: mysterious, god-like humanoids that want to exterminate us.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GO MELEE, GO RANGE, GO TACTICAL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The combat of CRETE is intense, fast, tactical and full of unique moments. Find your style and combine devastating Melee attacks with precise Range shots, use your abilities to create opportunities, protect yourself or your partner, or blast all your enemies at once.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2022610/extras/269924edecec8e2d86c55f93ff9384a1.poster.avif?t=1770388577\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2022610/extras/269924edecec8e2d86c55f93ff9384a1.webm?t=1770388577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2022610/extras/269924edecec8e2d86c55f93ff9384a1.mp4?t=1770388577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TRUE COOPERATIVE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play CRETE as a lonely warrior; however, playing together is the ultimate experience. Combine your attacks, protect each other, find your synchronised tactics and share your progress. Cooperation is not an option, but the only way to survive on this planet. The world is waiting to demonstrate the real meaning of teamwork. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2022610/extras/c743866c300fd3983841ed4d1abe2d36.poster.avif?t=1770388577\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2022610/extras/c743866c300fd3983841ed4d1abe2d36.webm?t=1770388577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2022610/extras/c743866c300fd3983841ed4d1abe2d36.mp4?t=1770388577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >IMPROVE USING BIOENGINEERING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mutate your body and weapons using DNA samples, mutations and organic devices. You will find dozens of biomechanical weapons, ready to be mutated with millions of combinations. Help to develop different buildings and investigations in the base camp and find new ways of getting stronger through advanced bioengineering.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2022610/extras/dff795563269a622a16049e5ae0360d9.poster.avif?t=1770388577\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2022610/extras/dff795563269a622a16049e5ae0360d9.webm?t=1770388577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2022610/extras/dff795563269a622a16049e5ae0360d9.mp4?t=1770388577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Mayhem Mirror Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2022610/e1b10332f18d5f8a16df7bdd3b5afeba730bc284/header.jpg?t=1770388577","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2022610/1813515076/1908be706e55b7e06a636bf93444e905eae5dc47/1757067707/dash_av1.mpd?t=1757073176","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2022610/1813515076/1908be706e55b7e06a636bf93444e905eae5dc47/1757067707/dash_h264.mpd?t=1757073176","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2022610/1813515076/1908be706e55b7e06a636bf93444e905eae5dc47/1757067707/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1757073176","id":257193617,"name":"CRETE - Gameplay Trailer 2025","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257193617/c49876432fac38ebc7633bd2d71f39ec92bc9121/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1757073176"}],"name":"CRETE","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel\u00ae Core\u2122 i5-2400 / AMD CPU with 4 physical cores @ 3Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA\u00ae GeForce\u00ae GTX 670 2GB / AMD Radeon R9 280 or better<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel\u00ae Core\u2122 i7-2600K / AMD Ryzen 5 1400<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA\u00ae GeForce\u00ae GTX 